{"availability":"available","full":"WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge","name":"TaskForge","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Productivity","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2025-04-07T19:17:06Z","updated":"2026-10-08T19:45:48Z","license":"Unlicense","branch":"main","homepage":"https://taskforge-alpha-six.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://taskforge-alpha-six.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.127Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.127Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.127Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.127Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A secure, full-stack task workspace — being built into a personal AI orchestration platform.","Live demo · Architecture · Roadmap · Status · Changelog","TaskForge is a production-deployed task management app built with React, TypeScript, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB. Users create an account, sign in, and manage their own private tasks with priorities, due dates, status tracking, search, and filters, starting each day from a task-driven Command Center."],"features":["Accounts and authentication. Register and sign in with email and password. Passwords are hashed with bcrypt; sessions use signed JWTs.","Private, user-owned data. Every task, project, and agent query on the server is scoped to the signed-in user. The API rejects cross-owner reads, edits, deletes, and task references; unit and real database tests cover…","Task management. Create, edit, and delete tasks with a title, description, status (to do / in progress / done), priority (low / medium / high), and due date.","Projects. Group tasks into private projects (active / completed / archived). Each project has its own page with tasks, progress, and activity. Deleting a project keeps its tasks and simply unassigns them.","Search, filter, and sort. Search by text, filter by status, priority, and assignee, and sort by created date, due date, or priority."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d82a5a584c5010b37d7fbc91b0cf2d57a295f9c6ec0610c378734d96a1b51cf5","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.295Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.295Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A secure, full-stack task workspace — being built into a personal AI orchestration platform.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Users create an account, sign in, and manage their own private tasks with priorities, due dates, status tracking, search, and filters, starting each day from a task-driven Command Center.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Register and sign in with email and password.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d82a5a584c5010b37d7fbc91b0cf2d57a295f9c6ec0610c378734d96a1b51cf5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.295Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T19:45:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WasteOfADrumBum/TaskForge/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:23.296Z","hash":"d82a5a584c5010b37d7fbc91b0cf2d57a295f9c6ec0610c378734d96a1b51cf5","originalBytes":16880,"storedBytes":16880,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","docs","client","server","run","npm","task","agent","demo","tasks","mongodb","project","images","production","real","local","render","see","tests","database","atlas","env","env.example","projects","sign","status","app","explicit","free","jwt","only","page","password","provider","typescript","vercel","assignment","audit","built","check","command","disabled","every","expired","mongo"